    "name": "create_validation_rule",
  },
  {
    "description": "Update a validation rule. Only the provided properties change. When the user is on a validation rule page (a settings path ending in /validation-rules/<id>), requests about a rule are about that one. An active rule rejects an invalid expression with the reason; an inactive rule only checks it when activated, so check it first with validate_validation_rule_expression. Keep the rule inactive unless the user asks to activate it.",
    "inputSchema": {
